1
00:00:17,888 --> 00:00:19,760
The Ugly Duckling

2
00:00:20,688 --> 00:00:24,352
Once upon a time, there was a mother duck.

3
00:00:24,736 --> 00:00:27,472
She had six little ducklings.

4
00:00:28,080 --> 00:00:31,424
Five of the ducklings were small and yellow,

5
00:00:31,824 --> 00:00:34,816
but the last duckling was big and grey.

6
00:00:35,712 --> 00:00:39,840
“He doesn’t look like us! What an ugly duckling!”

7
00:00:40,128 --> 00:00:41,664
the other ducklings said.

8
00:00:42,080 --> 00:00:44,960
“That’s not nice!” said Mother Duck.

9
00:00:45,536 --> 00:00:47,728
“He’s still a duck like us!”

10
00:00:48,816 --> 00:00:52,352
At the river, the ugly duckling swam well,

11
00:00:52,528 --> 00:00:54,816
just like all the other ducklings.

12
00:00:55,168 --> 00:00:59,904
But the other ducklings still laughed at him and told him to go away.

13
00:01:00,368 --> 00:01:03,248
It made the poor duckling very sad,

14
00:01:03,408 --> 00:01:06,528
so he decided to search for a new home.

